// Test: Simple ASSERT and REPORT rules
// Verifies both rule types generate correct Schematron elements

---- STAGE 1a ----

WITH BT-00-Text
    ASSERT BT-00-Text is present
    AS ERROR R-K7P-M2Q
    FOR BT-00-Text IN 1

    REPORT BT-00-Text is empty
    AS WARNING R-X3F-N8W
    FOR BT-00-Text IN 1
